<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!--
    冷却句和燃料名走组件类名 CompLaunchable、CompRefuelable，与官方载客穿梭机的注入键相同。
    不要改成 comps.1、comps.3。原模组的俄语用序号；作者若在组件列表前面插入一项，序号会指到别的组件上。
  -->

  <!-- EN: transport drone -->
  <TransportDrone.label>太空无人机</TransportDrone.label>
  <!-- EN: Drone for longer journeys and reaching orbit. Requires a shuttle engine, which can only be obtained from orbital traders and missions. Compared to a regular Shuttle, it has worse cargo capacity, faster recharge time before departure, and more efficient fuel consumption. -->
  <TransportDrone.description>太空无人机用于更远的旅程，也能抵达轨道。建造它需要一台穿梭机引擎。穿梭机引擎只能从轨道贸易商处购买，或通过任务取得。和载客穿梭机相比，它能装的货物更少，再次发射前等待的时间更短，消耗的化合燃料也更少。</TransportDrone.description>
  <!-- EN: {0} is ready to launch again. -->
  <TransportDrone.comps.CompLaunchable.cooldownEndedMessage>{0}已准备好再次发射。</TransportDrone.comps.CompLaunchable.cooldownEndedMessage>
  <!-- EN: Chemfuel -->
  <TransportDrone.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>化合燃料</TransportDrone.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Chemfuel -->
  <TransportDrone.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>化合燃料</TransportDrone.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>

</LanguageData>
